OL,3,GNEWSAWolves rule out Liquidator return
OL,4,
OL,5,FWolverhampton Wanderers have confirmed
OL,6,Fthey will not bring back their
OL,7,Fpre-match song The Liquidator after a
OL,8,Freview by the club.
OL,10,FThe song - which has historically
OL,11,Fprompted offensive chanting towards
OL,12,Frivals West Bromwich Albion - was
OL,13,Fpulled several years ago and has seen
OL,14,FWolves sanctioned by the Football
OL,15,FAssociation over the chanting.
OL,17,FThe club's new executive chairman
OL,18,FNathan Shi told supporters at a BBC
OL,19,FRadio WM Fan Forum in May that he would
OL,20,Freview the club's position but on
OL,21,FThursday confirmed the ban would remain
OL,22,Fin place.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
