OL,3,GNEWSAWolves rule out Liquidator return
OL,4,
OL,5,FWolves fan and podcaster Ryan Leister
OL,6,Fsaid it was disappointing as the song
OL,7,Fengaged fans before a home match but
OL,8,Fthe decision was "probably the outcome
OL,9,Fmost fans expected".
